# `.agent-contexts/` is process evidence and session drafts by its own README —
# the same class of maintainer-local material as the task-forest. No product code,
# CI job, or shipped doc depends on it; the docs that DO reference it are themselves
# local-only. Keep the whole tree local. Previously a curated subset was tracked;
# it is now untracked (files remain on disk).
/.agent-contexts/

